graph TB
    subgraph "lm-evaluation-harness (Batch Job)"
        direction TB
        subgraph Adapter["EvalHub Adapter (main.py)"]
            LMEvalAdapter["LMEvalAdapter<br/>FrameworkAdapter"]
            JobParser["Job Spec Parser<br/>/meta/job.json"]
            ErrorSanitizer["Error Sanitizer<br/>Redacts secrets from errors"]
            CodeExecGate["Code Execution Gate<br/>Allowlist: HumanEval etc."]
            DisconnectedDetect["Disconnected Mode<br/>Auto-detect /test_data"]
            ResultReporter["Result Reporter<br/>Callbacks + OCI artifacts"]
        end

        subgraph Core["lm_eval (Core Framework)"]
            SimpleEvaluate["simple_evaluate() API"]
            TaskManager["Task Manager<br/>60+ benchmarks"]
            ModelInterface["Model Interface<br/>local-completions backend"]
            Metrics["Metrics Computation<br/>scikit-learn"]
        end

        subgraph CLI["lm-eval CLI"]
            CLIEntry["cli_evaluate()<br/>Standalone evaluation"]
        end

        LMEvalAdapter -->|wraps| SimpleEvaluate
        JobParser -->|configures| LMEvalAdapter
        LMEvalAdapter -->|sanitizes errors| ErrorSanitizer
        LMEvalAdapter -->|gates code exec| CodeExecGate
        LMEvalAdapter -->|checks| DisconnectedDetect
        LMEvalAdapter -->|reports results| ResultReporter
        SimpleEvaluate -->|loads tasks| TaskManager
        SimpleEvaluate -->|uses| ModelInterface
        SimpleEvaluate -->|computes| Metrics
        CLIEntry -->|calls| SimpleEvaluate
    end

    Operator["TrustyAI / LMEval Operator<br/>Creates K8s Jobs"] -->|launches| LMEvalAdapter
    JobSpec["ConfigMap<br/>/meta/job.json"] -->|mounted as| JobParser

    ModelInterface -->|POST /v1/completions| ModelEndpoint["Model Inference Endpoint<br/>OpenAI-compatible API"]
    ResultReporter -->|status + results| EvalHub["EvalHub Service"]
    ResultReporter -->|push artifacts| OCIRegistry["OCI Registry"]
    DisconnectedDetect -->|offline fallback| TestData["/test_data Mount<br/>Pre-staged tokenizers + datasets"]
    TaskManager -->|downloads| HFHub["HuggingFace Hub"]

    style LMEvalAdapter fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style SimpleEvaluate fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style CLIEntry fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style ErrorSanitizer fill:#e8744f,color:#fff
    style CodeExecGate fill:#e8744f,color:#fff
    style DisconnectedDetect fill:#7ed321
    style Operator fill:#999,color:#fff
    style ModelEndpoint fill:#f5a623
    style EvalHub fill:#7ed321
    style OCIRegistry fill:#f5a623
    style HFHub fill:#f5a623
    style TestData fill:#d5e8d4
